dit['sort_order']??'10')?>"></div><div class="field"><label>توضیح</label><textarea name="description" rows="3"><?=e($edit['description']??'')?></textarea></div><button class="form-btn" style="background:var(--gold);color:#0a0908">ذخیره آیتم</button></form></div><div class="admin-card"><h2>آیتم‌های فعلی</h2><div class="admin-list"><?php foreach($items as $i):?><div class="admin-row"><div class="admin-row-main"><img src="<?=url('assets/images/'.$i['image'])?>"><div><b><?=e($i['name'])?></b><span><?=e($i['category_name'])?> · <?=money($i['price'])?> · <?=e($i['barcode'])?></span></div></div><div><a class="btn" href="<?=url('admin/cafe?edit='.$i['id'])?>">ویرایش</a><form method="post" style="display:inline"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=csrf()?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="delete"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?=$i['id']?>"><button class="admin-delete">حذف</button></form></div></div><?php endforeach;?></div></div></div></div></section>
